/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Macrophage\040response\040to\040Mycobacterium\040tuberculosis\040infection)
/Author (David\040Gammack\054\040Charles\040R\056\040Doering\054\040Denise\040E\056\040Kirschner)
/Subject (The\040immune\040response\040to\040Mycobacterium\040tuberculosis\040\050Mtb\051\040infection\040is\040the\040for\055\040mation\040of\040multicellular\040lesions\054\040or\040granolomas\054\040in\040the\040lung\040of\040the\040individual\056\040However\054\040the\040structure\040of\040the\040granulomas\040and\040the\040spatial\040distribution\040of\040the\040immune\040cells\040within\040is\040not\040well\040understood\056\040In\040this\040paper\040we\040develop\040a\040mathematical\040model\040investigating\040the\040early\040and\040initial\040immune\040response\040to\040Mtb\056\040The\040model\040consists\040of\040coupled\040reaction\055diffusion\055advection\040partial\040differen\055\040tial\040equations\040governing\040the\040dynamics\040of\040the\040relevant\040macrophage\040and\040bacteria\040populations\040and\040a\040bacteria\055produced\040chemokine\056\040Our\040novel\040application\040of\040mathematical\040concepts\040of\040internal\040states\040and\040internal\040velocity\040allows\040us\040to\040begin\040to\040study\040this\040unique\040immunological\040structure\056\040Volume\040changes\040resulting\040from\040proliferation\040and\040death\040terms\040generate\040a\040velocity\040field\040by\040which\040all\040cells\040are\040transported\040within\040the\040forming\040granuloma\056\040We\040present\040numerical\040results\040for\040two\040distinct\040infection\040outcomes\072\040controlled\040and\040uncontrolled\040granuloma\040growth\056\040Using\040a\040simplified\040model\040we\040are\040able\040to\040analytically\040determine\040conditions\040under\040which\040the\040bacteria\040population\040decreases\054\040representing\040early\040clearance\040of\040infection\054\040or\040grows\054\040represent\055\040ing\040the\040initial\040stages\040of\040granuloma\040formation\056)
/Keywords (01\040Feb\0402004\054\040Journal\040of\040Mathematical\040Biology\054\040Population\054\040University\040of\040Michigan)
